` all pass. I only ran the three commands the spec lists; I didn't run the repo's other checks (ruff, pytest, `pnpm build`).\n\nWhat I changed in `bridge.ts`:\n- I added an exported `startShellStore()` right after `storeOfGlobal()`. It returns `storeOfGlobal()`.\n- I call `startShellStore()` once at module level, right after its definition.\n- I updated the doc comments on `shellStore` and `useShell` to say the store is made at start rather than at the first `useShell()`.", "ttft_ms": 1968, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 22587, "uuid": "e8a19d5b-f097-4c5f-a345-97203359139e", "ttft_stream_ms": 1251, "time_to_request_ms": 52, "first_content_frame_ms": 1251, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
